  {
    "id": 6007001070010,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "だぁーっ！　悔しい！　ほんっとーに悔しい！！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700107/6007001070010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ゆ、結華……？！",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007001070020,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "こんなに悔しいの生まれて初めてだよっ、プロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700107/6007001070020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな……俺だって悔しい\r\n結華が頑張ってたのは知ってるから",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、次がある",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007001070030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……わかってるよ。ここで止まってなんかいられない\r\n次に向けて頑張らないといけないって",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700107/6007001070030"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007001070040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "でもね、『W.I.N.G.』で応援してくれたファンの期待を、\r\n三峰は裏切っちゃったんだよ。それがすごく悔しい",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700107/6007001070040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ならなおさら、今回応えられなかった分、\r\n次こそ応えられるように頑張ろう",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結華は、今の悔しさを成長に繋げられる人だ",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007001070050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そこまでできた人間かはわからないけど……\r\n……そうだよね、いつまでも引きずってはいられないよね",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700107/6007001070050"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007001070060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……早く良い結果出せるように頑張るからさ\r\nこれからもプロデュース、よろしくね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
